right"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"William T. Sherman / John A. McClernand"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Held near Jones Field before renewed mid-afternoon attacks"}]]}]]]}],["$","section","Confederacy",{"className":"command-column #9a3d32","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Confederacy"}],[["$","div","Army of the Mississippi until about 2:30 p.m.",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Army of the Mississippi until about 2:30 p.m."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Albert Sidney Johnston"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Organized and personally led the eastern attack; killed after the peach orchard fell"}]]}],["$","div","Army of the Mississippi after Johnston’s death",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Army of the Mississippi after Johnston’s death"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"P.G.T. Beauregard"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Continued directing the battle from the rear"}]]}],["$","div","Eastern battlefield after Johnston’s death",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Eastern battlefield after Johnston’s death"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Braxton Bragg"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Renewed pressure against Hurlbut along the Hamburg–Savannah Road"}]]}],["$","div","Reserve Corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Reserve Corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"John C. Breckinridge"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Statham’s and Bowen’s brigades in Johnston’s main assault"}]]}],["$","div","Fresh brigades",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fresh brigades"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"William S. Statham / John S. Bowen"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Ten regiments attacking Hurlbut and MacArthur"}]]}],["$","div","Brigades on the Confederate right",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Brigades on the Confederate right"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"John K. Jackson / James R. Chalmers"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Jackson turned toward MacArthur; Chalmers pursued Stuart through the ravine"}]]}],["$","div","Brigades attacking Prentiss",{"className":"command-entry","children":["$L22","$L23","$L24"]}]]]}]]}],"$L25","$L26"]}]
